### K4 — checksummed append-only journal torn-tail recovery (component-level; reduces the risk behind U-4)
- execution_id `exec-84xq7mzu`, exit 0, stderr empty, code sha256 `8263a266ab04efadbf98e48bbac5bb5af4f5930d34240c623ef91427c668acf4`.
